---
args: { items: AssessmentItemDraft[], competencies: CompetencyTrace[] }
returns: ScoringCriteriaSet
---
For each item's intended evidence, state the observable reasoning or result required by each score level. Link each criterion to the competency evidence task it measures. Keep spelling, handwriting, speed, and stylistic preference outside the score unless the blueprint expressly identifies that feature as the competency. Return criterion-to-evidence links and explicit maximum/minimum bounds.
